WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.000
[heavy breathing]

00:00:07.791 --> 00:00:09.208
[groans]

00:00:10.166 --> 00:00:11.833
[groans] N-No...

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.583
Th-This is wrong...

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:27.166
We-- We shouldn't be... here.

00:00:32.708 --> 00:00:36.208
[screaming]

00:00:39.291 --> 00:00:40.791
[screaming continues]

00:00:45.375 --> 00:00:48.333
[screaming continues]

00:00:52.291 --> 00:00:53.875
[grunts]

00:01:08.125 --> 00:01:11.458
[sustained high-pitched tone]

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:21.375
Where are you?!

00:01:21.458 --> 00:01:24.666
[roaring, whooshing]

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:26.250
[noises subside]

00:01:26.333 --> 00:01:28.208
[crickets chirping]

00:01:33.291 --> 00:01:35.291
[thunderous stomping]

00:01:48.083 --> 00:01:50.333
Are you still here?!

00:01:52.041 --> 00:01:54.083
[whooshing]

00:02:01.416 --> 00:02:04.416
[whooshing increases]

00:02:13.333 --> 00:02:15.166
[whooshing]

00:02:28.875 --> 00:02:30.291
[gasping]

00:02:33.708 --> 00:02:36.458
[gasping, panting]

00:02:43.166 --> 00:02:45.000
[gasping]

00:02:52.208 --> 00:02:54.541
[thunder crashes]

00:03:07.916 --> 00:03:10.958
-[thunder crashing]
-[whirring]

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:15.416
[whirring increases]

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:19.958
[whooshing]

00:03:21.916 --> 00:03:23.583
Please!

00:03:23.666 --> 00:03:26.416
Tell me where you are!

00:03:37.708 --> 00:03:40.625
[clattering sounds]

00:03:49.625 --> 00:03:51.250
[doors clanks]

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:00.708
Take my hand!

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:12.916
Please!

00:04:38.041 --> 00:04:40.583
[whooshing increases]

00:04:41.875 --> 00:04:44.333
[sustained buzzing sound]

00:04:44.416 --> 00:04:45.250
[silence]

00:04:45.583 --> 00:04:48.541
[gasping, panting]

00:04:52.458 --> 00:04:54.625
[panting slows]

00:04:57.625 --> 00:04:59.958
[sighing heavily]

00:05:01.208 --> 00:05:02.666
Oh, God.

00:05:04.333 --> 00:05:09.083
I'm sure there must have been a time
when I had nice dreams.

00:05:09.208 --> 00:05:12.875
[sighs] Maybe when
I lived in palaces and mansions?

00:05:15.208 --> 00:05:16.750
But maybe not.

00:05:18.125 --> 00:05:19.750
That was all stress.

00:05:20.791 --> 00:05:22.708
Doing my little dance for coins,

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:25.458
making sure I had enough for the next...

00:05:25.708 --> 00:05:28.416
[sighs] month, the next year.

00:05:31.333 --> 00:05:32.916
Never bloody easy, was it?

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:34.208
[snaps fingers]

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:38.291
And then...

00:05:38.375 --> 00:05:39.750
there was you.

00:05:42.583 --> 00:05:44.541
Did I dream when you were here?

00:05:45.875 --> 00:05:46.750
I don't know.

00:05:48.375 --> 00:05:51.208
I was too focused on our daylight hours.

00:05:52.916 --> 00:05:55.583
I never wanted to sleep in those days.

00:05:57.083 --> 00:05:59.291
And now here I am again.

00:06:00.583 --> 00:06:02.750
Never wanting to sleep.

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:06.750
Not until I find you.

00:06:08.875 --> 00:06:12.875
Not until I live
in the good dream again.

00:06:13.791 --> 00:06:15.583
[pen scratching on paper]

00:06:15.666 --> 00:06:17.791
Not until you're back.

